                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Instructions to blockading vessels and cruisers.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Navy Department</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-06-20"><hi rendition="#italic">June 20,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush">General Orders<lb/>No. 492.</p>
                <p>The following “Instructions to blockading vessels and cruisers,” prepared by the
                    Department of State, are published for the information and guidance of the naval
                    service.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">John D. Long</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Secretary.</hi></signed>
                </closer>



